{"id":"9e21d4389ef62bd0","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-topos-equivalence.md","title":"thm-topos-subobject-fibration-equivalence","display":"thm-topos-subobject-fibration-equivalence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-topos-equivalence","aliases":["16-thm-topos-equivalence","16-thm--topos-equivalence"],"display":"thm-topos-subobject-fibration-equivalence","depends_on":["[[16-df-topos-5]]","[[16-df-subobject-fibration]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-topos-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-topos-equivalence</span><span>16-thm--topos-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-topos-subobject-fibration-equivalence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8cc0e0e038ae9b87\" href=\"?note=8cc0e0e038ae9b87\" title=\"16-df-topos-5\">16-df-topos-5</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c23c06c4d297e8d\" href=\"?note=6c23c06c4d297e8d\" title=\"16-df-subobject-fibration\">16-df-subobject-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为具有有限极限的范畴；这是本页子对象纤维化构造的定义域条件。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cod}=p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal E)\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(\\operatorname{cod}=p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal E)\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6c23c06c4d297e8d\" href=\"?note=6c23c06c4d297e8d\" title=\"16-df-subobject-fibration\">16-df-subobject-fibration</a> 的关系商、拉回重索引及投影构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElemTopos}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElemTopos}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinLim}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinLim}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HOFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{HOFib}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8cc0e0e038ae9b87\" href=\"?note=8cc0e0e038ae9b87\" title=\"16-df-topos-5\">16-df-topos-5</a> 中明确引用的本书定义；子对象投影取该页同一构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}topos\\text{-}subobject\\text{-}fibration\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal E)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal E)\\land\n\\mathrm{HOFib}(\\operatorname{cod}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal E)\\to\\mathcal E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}topos\\text{-}subobject\\text{-}fibration\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal E)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal E)\\land\n\\mathrm{HOFib}(\\operatorname{cod}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal E)\\to\\mathcal E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>有限极限条件也绑定在Hypothesis中，保证所引用的拉回重索引构造有定义；它仍显式保留在右侧，便于与原书的刻画比较。仅给任意范畴时，不能在检验拉回存在之前调用本目录只在有拉回时定义的子对象纤维化。高阶子对象纤维化提供幂对象/分类子结构。来源为Definition5.3.5（印刷334／PDF354）与Corollary5.4.9（印刷345／PDF365）；正向使用后者，反向使用前者及Lemma5.3.6的分类子、指数构造。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-topos-5","status":"resolved","id":"8cc0e0e038ae9b87","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-topos-5]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6c23c06c4d297e8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-subobject-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-subobject-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"6c23c06c4d297e8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{cod}=p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal E)\\to\\mathcal E$ 取 [[16-df-subobject-fibration]] 的关系商、拉回重索引及投影构造。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-topos-5","status":"resolved","id":"8cc0e0e038ae9b87","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$、$\\mathrm{FinLim}$、$\\mathrm{HOFib}$ 采用 [[16-df-topos-5]] 中明确引用的本书定义；子对象投影取该页同一构造。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cod}=p_{\\mathrm{Sub}}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal E)\\to\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElemTopos}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinLim}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HOFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}topos\\text{-}subobject\\text{-}fibration\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathcal E)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FinLim}(\\mathcal E)\\land\n\\mathrm{HOFib}(\\operatorname{cod}:\\mathbf{Sub}(\\mathcal E)\\to\\mathcal E).","display":true}],"bytes":1637,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-460","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-topos-equivalence|thm-topos-subobject-fibration-equivalence]]"}],"outgoing":["8cc0e0e038ae9b87","6c23c06c4d297e8d"]}